{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20233","headline":"峡哀 九 · 孟郊","name":"峡哀 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峡水劒戟狞，峡舟霹雳翔。\n因依虺蜴手，起坐风雨忙。\n峡旅多窜官，峡氓多非良。\n滑心不可求，滑习积已长。\n漠漠涎雾起，齗齗涎水光。\n渴贤如之何，忽在水中央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}